  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -12,
        38
      ],
      "id": 58,
      "text": "ESP-IDF's SPI master driver with DMA on SPI2 (SCLK\nGPIO6, MOSI GPIO7, MISO GPIO2): an MCP3208 ADC\n(CS GPIO10, 1 MHz) reads RV1 on CH0, and a W25Q32\nflash (CS GPIO3, 4 MHz). Analyzer > UART (UART0)\nshows the flash's JEDEC ID (EF 40 16), \"Flash:\nSimNodus\" written and read back, and CH0's code and\nmillivolts every 0.5 s; drag RV1 while running."
    }
  ],
